   "id": "s1",
   "heading": {
    "zh": "名字和特征",
    "en": "Name and features",
    "ms": "Nama dan ciri"
   },
   "level": "basic",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:coleoptera}}的名字来自希腊文 koleos（鞘）加 pteron（翅），意思是「有鞘的翅」：甲虫坚硬的前翅像刀鞘一样，把后翅收在里面。",
      "en": "{{t:coleoptera}} comes from the Greek koleos (sheath) and pteron (wing): 'sheath-winged'. A beetle's hard forewings cover the hind wings like a sheath.",
      "ms": "{{t:coleoptera}} berasal daripada bahasa Yunani koleos (sarung) dan pteron (sayap): 'bersayap sarung'. Sayap depan kumbang yang keras menutupi sayap belakang seperti sarung."
     },
     "defines": [
      "coleoptera"
     ],
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "ids": [
      "longhorn-pseudomyagrus",
      "scarab-ceroplophana",
      "oryctes-rhinoceros-adult"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「鞘」就是刀鞘：硬翅像刀鞘一样包住后翅。",
      "en": "Think 'sheath': hard covers sheathing the flying wings.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'sarung': penutup keras menyarungi sayap terbang."
     },
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "前翅硬化成鞘翅，两片在背中线对齐",
       "en": "Forewings hardened into elytra that meet in a straight line down the back",
       "ms": "Sayap depan mengeras menjadi elitra yang bertemu dalam garis lurus di belakang"
      },
      {
       "zh": "膜质的后翅折叠在鞘翅下面",
       "en": "Membranous hind wings folded under the elytra",
       "ms": "Sayap belakang bermembran dilipat di bawah elitra"
      },
      {
       "zh": "咀嚼式口器",
       "en": "Chewing mouthparts",
       "ms": "Bahagian mulut mengunyah"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
      "WTK:1",
      "TJ:40",
      "UMN-ORD"
     ]
    }
   ]
